  "description": "Rearrange an array such that nums[0] < nums[1] > nums[2] < nums[3]...",
  "target": null,
  "pseudocode": "1. sorted = nums.sort((a,b) => a - b)\n2. n = nums.length\n3. mid = Math.floor((n + 1) / 2)\n4. left = sorted.slice(0, mid).reverse()\n5. right = sorted.slice(mid).reverse()\n6. for i from 0 to n-1:\n7.   nums[i] = (i % 2 === 0) ? left[Math.floor(i/2)] : right[Math.floor(i/2)]",
